1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,927
"Fail to reject" does not mean H0 is true.

2
00:00:04,377 --> 00:00:06,873
It means you didn't find enough evidence against it.

3
00:00:07,123 --> 00:00:07,955
That's all.

4
00:00:08,405 --> 00:00:12,650
And one mistake to avoid: choosing alpha after you've seen the p-value.

5
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,161
You pick the cutoff before you look at the data.

6
